OL,5,G1520 Four in a Bed
OL,6,     FAt Sleeperdorm Backpacker Hotel in
OL,7,     FNewcastle, Ian hopes his guests
OL,8,     Fwill leave their designer gear at
OL,9,     Fthe door and bunk up in his cheap
OL,10,     Fand cheerful dorms. But things
OL,11,     Fturn sour over dinner.
OL,12,G1550 Four in a Bed
OL,13,     FThe final visit is to The
OL,14,     FParsonage Hotel and Spa in York,
OL,15,     Fwhere Mark and Natalie hope to
OL,16,     Fimpress their guests with their
OL,17,     Fcountry manor, complete with pub,
OL,18,     Fspa and restaurant.
